  "voices": {
    "about": "How spoken lines (a pack's audio/voices.json) are mixed, on the voice bus: one advisor line and one unit reply at a time at most, no reply starting while the advisor speaks, and the sound effects and music held down by duck_db while anyone speaks. An advisor line that comes while another speaks waits in a queue of `queue.size`, the highest `line_priority` first (lines not listed take `default`); one that has waited over `queue.stale_ms` is dropped, and so are the least important beyond the queue's size.",
